<title>GREECE: NATL MORTGAGE SAYS MAIN BRANCH CLOSED APR 23 FOR AGM.</title>
<headline>NATL MORTGAGE SAYS MAIN BRANCH CLOSED APR 23 FOR AGM.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Mortgage Bank said its main branch at Panepistimiou 40 will be closed to the public after 10:00 local because of its scheduled repeat shareholders meeting.</p>
<p>Clients may be serviced at its Akadimias 65 branch. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
